column2:
My lord — why do you weep? Why is your heart [sick?]
8	Today I myself will br[ing] your ball [up] from the earth;
9	I myself will bri[ng] your mallet up from the earth!

If [you go down] to the earth,
12	[you must hold fast] to my instruction:
13	[you must not put on] a clean garment,
14	or they will kn[ow you] for the stranger you are;
15	you must not anoint yourself with sweet oil from the flask,
16	or at its scent they will gather about you;
17	you must not sling a throw-stick in the earth,
18	or those the throw-stick struck will ring you round;
19	you must not carry a cudgel in your hand,
20	or the shades will shudder away from you;
21	you must not put shoes on your feet;
22	you must not raise a cry in the earth;
23	you must not kiss the wife you love;
24	you must not strike the wife you hate;
25	you must not kiss the son you love;
26	you must not strike the son you hate —
27	or the outcry of the earth will s[ei]ze you:
28	'She who lies, she who lies — the mother of Ninazu, she who lies:
29	her pure shoulders are not covered with a garment;
30	her breast, like an unguent-jar, is not draped.'

She who lies, [she who l]ies — the mother of Ninazu, she who li[es:]
49	her pure shoulders are not covered with a garment;
50	her breast, like an unguent-jar, is not draped.

Father [Enli]l — today my ball fell down into the earth,
58	my mallet fell down into the earth,
59	and Enkidu, who [went down] to bring th[em] up — [the earth seized him!]
60	Namtar did not seize him; the Demon did not seize him; the earth seized him;
61	the merciless ambusher Nergal did not seize him; the earth seized him;
62	he did not fall [on the field of the batt]le of males; the earth seized him!

Father Sîn — today my ball fell down into the earth,
66	my mallet fell down [into the earth,]
67	and Enkidu, who [went down] to bring th[em] up — [the earth seized him!]
68	Namtar did not seize him; the Demon did not seize him; the earth seized him;
69	the mercile[ss] ambusher Nergal [did not seiz]e him; the earth seized him;
70	he did [n]ot fall on [the field of the battle of males;] the earth seized him!
